{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disclaimer, all media shown on the current store page is work-in progress footage  and does not reflect the quality of the final game</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the latest updates, check out the official Sand Eaters YouTube channel!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/RM-993_Tech_Reaper_Loadout.jpg?t=1751059565\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FORGE. DESTROY. EVOLVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a walking arsenal in SAND EATERS, a hybrid genre sci-fi shooter set in a dark future plagued by rapidly evolving nanomachine lifeforms called Hive Golems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/SE_livingweapon.gif?t=1751059565\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LIVING WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify your cybernetic body to grant enhanced combat benefits to firepower, mobility, and durability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/SE_playtest.gif?t=1751059565\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FLUID COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a dynamic combat system giving you extreme mobility and opening new ways to express movement and gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/SE_Environments.gif?t=1751059565\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMMERSIVE ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location in Sand Eaters is handcrafted to deliver rich gameplay and visuals, immersing you in dynamic environments filled with intricate details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/SE_arsenal.gif?t=1751059565\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> DEEP LOADOUT CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mech-genre style loadout customization that allows you to forge the perfect arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/SE_evolvingenemies.gif?t=1751059565\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EVOLVING ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hive Golem lifeforms can re-construct themselves mid-combat capable of evolving into a larger threat. Deal with them swiftly and destroy their cores to reduce them to nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/SE_playtest2.gif?t=1751059565\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More coming soon! Wishlist now!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For regular updates follow Sand Eaters on YouTube and check out the website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game developed by Fiddler Crab Studios<br><br>for business inquiries and questions fill out the contact form on the Sand Eaters website. <br>Thank you!  <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3384370?t=1751059565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3384370?t=1751059565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/016e06509bc935b033b89bb9184fefc677bffa0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751059565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.